BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Internal control recommendations, not a certification standard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (Use role-based access, documented onboarding, and a checklist for reviewer sign-off. Sample closed files for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (unsupported links, inconsistent calculations, missing consent, and retention errors. Record corrective actions with an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (owner and due date rather than quietly fixing the exported report alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (Define suspension triggers for repeated evidence errors, unauthorized access, misleading outreach, or uncertain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (licensing. Revoke departing personnel's access promptly and preserve required records. Have counsel assess worker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (classification and vendor agreements; calling a worker a contractor does not determine their legal status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm (Type: control) Tj ET
